,"text":"யர்","tr":"yar"}]},{"text":"தண்கட","tr":"taṇkaṭa","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தண்","tr":"taṇ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"கட","tr":"kaṭa"}]},{"text":"னாட்டே","tr":"ṉāṭṭē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"னாட்","tr":"ṉāṭ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"டே","tr":"ṭē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"வீழ்","parts":[{"text":"வீழ்","lemma":"வீழ்","gloss":"prop-root"}],"gloss":"prop-root"},{"surface":"தாழ்","parts":[{"text":"தாழ்","lemma":"தாழ்","gloss":"hanging-down"}],"gloss":"hanging-down"},{"surface":"தாழை","parts":[{"text":"தாழை","lemma":"தாழை","gloss":"screw-pine"}],"gloss":"screw-pine"},{"surface":"ஊழ்","parts":[{"text":"ஊழ்","lemma":"ஊழ்","gloss":"mature"}],"gloss":"mature"},{"surface":"உறு","parts":[{"text":"உறு","lemma":"உறு","gloss":"having"}],"gloss":"having"},{"surface":"கொழு","parts":[{"text":"கொழு","lemma":"கொழு","gloss":"fat"}],"gloss":"fat"},{"surface":"முகை","parts":[{"text":"முகை","lemma":"முகை","gloss":"bud"}],"gloss":"bud"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"குருகு","parts":[{"text":"குருகு","lemma":"குருகு","gloss":"heron"}],"gloss":"heron"},{"surface":"உளர்","parts":[{"text":"உளர்","lemma":"உளர்","gloss":"preening"}],"gloss":"preening"},{"surface":"இறகின்","parts":[{"text":"இறகு","lemma":"இறகு","gloss":"feather"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like the feather"},{"surface":"விரிபு","parts":[{"text":"விரிபு","lemma":"விரி","gloss":"expanding"}],"gloss":"expanding"},{"surface":"தோடு","parts":[{"text":"தோடு","lemma":"தோடு","gloss":"petal"}],"gloss":"petal"},{"surface":"அவிழும்","parts":[{"text":"அவிழும்","lemma":"அவிழ்","gloss":"opening"}],"gloss":"opening"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கானல்","parts":[{"text":"கானல்","lemma":"கானல்","gloss":"seashore grove"}],"gloss":"seashore grove"},{"surface":"நண்ணிய","parts":[{"text":"நண்ணிய","lemma":"நண்ணு","gloss":"approached"}],"gloss":"close to"},{"surface":"சிறு","parts":[{"text":"சிறு","lemma":"சிறு","gloss":"small"}],"gloss":"small"},{"surface":"குடி","parts":[{"text":"குடி","lemma":"குடி","gloss":"hamlet"}],"gloss":"hamlet"},{"surface":"முன்றில்","parts":[{"text":"முன்றில்","lemma":"முன்றில்","gloss":"front yard"}],"gloss":"front yard"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"திரைவந்து","parts":[{"text":"திரைவந்து","lemma":"திரைவந்து","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"பெயரும்","parts":[{"text":"பெயரும்","lemma":"பெயரும்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"என்பநத்","parts":[{"text":"என்பநத்","lemma":"என்பநத்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"துறந்து","parts":[{"text":"துறந்து","lemma":"துறந்து","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"நெடுஞ்சே","parts":[{"text":"நெடுஞ்சே","lemma":"நெடுஞ்சே","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"ணாட்டார்","parts":[{"text":"ணாட்டார்","lemma":"ணாட்டார்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"ஆயினும்","parts":[{"text":"ஆயினும்","lemma":"ஆயினும்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"நெஞ்சிற்","parts":[{"text":"நெஞ்சிற்","lemma":"நெஞ்சிற்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கணியர்","parts":[{"text":"கணியர்","lemma":"கணியர்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தண்கட","parts":[{"text":"தண்கட","lemma":"தண்கட","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"னாட்டே","parts":[{"text":"னாட்டே","lemma":"னாட்டே","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true}],"literal":"Hanging-root low screw-pine's mature fat bud / heron preening wing-like expanding petal opening / seashore grove close-to small hamlet front yard / wave having come returns, they say; us having abandoned / long distant land-he-is although / to the heart close-he-is, cool sea land-he!","translation":"The fat buds of the screw-pine, with hanging prop-roots, open their petals like the preened feathers of a heron, in the front yard of the small hamlet close to the seashore grove where waves come and recede. They say he has abandoned us and is in a far-off land; yet, the lord of the cool seashore is ever close to my heart.","modern":"தாழ்ந்து தொங்கும் விழுதுகளை உடைய தாழையின் முதிர்ந்த கொழுவிய மொட்டு, நாரை தன் இறகுகளைக் கோதி விரிப்பது போல இதழ்கள் விரிந்து மலரும். அலைகள் வந்து மீளும் நெய்தல் நிலக் கானலை அடுத்த சிறுகுடியின் முற்றத்தில் இத்தகைய தாழை மலரும் தண்கடல் நாட்டை உடைய நம் தலைவர், நம்மைத் துறந்து நெடுந்தொலைவு நாட்டிற்குச் சென்றார் ஆயினும், என் நெஞ்சிற்கு மிக அருகில் உள்ளவர் ஆவார் என்று தோழிக்குத் தலைவி கூறுகிறாள்.","explanation":"This poem is spoken by the heroine to her confidante in the neytal (coastal) landscape. The heroine's lover has departed to a distant land to earn wealth, leaving her in grief. People say he has abandoned her, but she asserts that even though he is physically far away, he remains intimately close to her heart. The imagery of the screw-pine bud opening its petals like a heron preening its feathers in the front yard of the coastal hamlet, where waves constantly come and go, beautifully evokes the coastal landscape. The coming and going of the waves symbolizes the constant cycle of his memory returning to her, keeping him close to her heart despite the physical distance. Key words include 'நெஞ்சிற்கு அணியர்' (close to the heart) and 'தண்கடல் நாட்டே' (lord of the cool sea land).","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}